#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""tesla - every command of the Tesla tools, in one place.

NAME
    tesla - run a Tesla tools command

SYNOPSIS
    ./tesla                         list the commands
    ./tesla <group> <command> [options]
    ./tesla <group> <command> -h    that command's own help
    ./tesla <old script name> [options]   (e.g. ./tesla sync_api_tessie.py --drives) still works

DESCRIPTION
    The scripts themselves live in Tools/commands/ (one-off tools in Tools/maintenance/). The app (tesla_app.py) runs the
    same code, so a command here and a button in the app do the same thing.
"""
